## Architecture Overview

```
subscriptionsavvy/  (monorepo root)
├── apps/
│   ├── web/              # Next.js 14 App Router (primary)
│   └── mobile/           # Expo SDK 51 + Expo Router v3
├── packages/
│   ├── db/               # Supabase client + shared types + schema
│   └── utils/            # Currency conversion, date helpers, formatters
├── turbo.json
└── package.json
```

### Tech Stack

| Layer | Web | Mobile |
|-------|-----|--------|
| Framework | Next.js 14 (App Router) | Expo SDK 51 + Expo Router v3 |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v3 + Framer Motion | NativeWind v4 + Reanimated 3 |
| Auth | Supabase Auth (email/password + magic link) | Supabase Auth (same) |
| Database | Supabase PostgreSQL (serverless) | Supabase PostgreSQL (same) |
| Charts | Recharts (web) | Victory Native (mobile) |
| Icons | Lucide React (web) | Lucide React Native (mobile) |
| State | Zustand + TanStack Query | Zustand + TanStack Query |
| Notifications | Resend (via Supabase Edge Function) | Expo Notifications (push) |
| Date picker | react-day-picker | @react-native-community/datetimepicker |
| CSV export | papaparse | expo-sharing + papaparse |
| Monorepo | Turborepo | Turborepo |

