## Design System (from UI/UX Pro Max Skill)

### Color Palette — "Ink & Amber"
```
--color-base:       #0D1117   (deep ink navy — background)
--color-surface:    #161B22   (card surfaces — slightly lighter)
--color-surface-2:  #1C2128   (elevated cards)
--color-amber:      #F5A623   (primary accent — CTAs, highlights)
--color-teal:       #2A9D8F   (secondary accent — charts, tags)
--color-offwhite:   #F7F3EE   (light mode bg / dark mode text)
--color-text:       #E6EDF3   (primary text on dark)
--color-muted:      #8B949E   (secondary text)
--color-danger:     #F85149   (overdue, destructive)
--color-success:    #3FB950   (paid, success states)
--color-warning:    #E3B341   (due today, alerts)
```

### Typography — Plus Jakarta Sans
- Headline: 800 weight, -0.04em letter-spacing, clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem)
- Subhead: 600 weight
- Body: 400 weight, 1.6 line-height
- Caption: 300 weight, muted color
- Numeric display: 800 weight, tabular-nums, amber color

### Card Design Philosophy
- No drop shadows — use `border: 1px solid rgba(240,246,252,0.1)` instead
- Background: `#161B22` with `background-image: url("noise.svg")` grain texture
- Border-radius: 16px
- Hover: border color shifts to amber, subtle scale(1.01)

---

## Database Schema (Supabase PostgreSQL)

```sql
-- Subscriptions table
create table subscriptions (
  id uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(),
  user_id uuid references auth.users not null,
  name text not null,
  category text not null,          -- entertainment, productivity, health, etc.
  cost numeric(10,2) not null,
  currency text default 'INR',      -- multi-currency
  billing_cycle text not null,      -- monthly, yearly, weekly, custom
  next_payment date not null,
  trial_ends_on date,               -- trial tracker
  status text default 'active',    -- active, cancelled, paused
  notes text,
  logo_color text,                  -- for colored initial avatars
  created_at timestamptz default now()
);

-- Payment history (for trends)
create table payment_history (
  id uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(),
  subscription_id uuid references subscriptions on delete cascade,
  user_id uuid references auth.users not null,
  amount numeric(10,2) not null,
  currency text default 'INR',
  paid_at timestamptz default now()
);

-- User settings
create table user_settings (
  user_id uuid primary key references auth.users,
  base_currency text default 'INR',
  monthly_budget numeric(10,2),
  email_reminders boolean default true,
  reminder_days_before int default 3,
  display_name text,
  theme text default 'dark'         -- dark / light
);

-- RLS policies (all enabled — users only see their own data)
```

