## Features Implementation

### 🔴 High Priority

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| **Trial Tracker** | `trial_ends_on` field on subscription. Dashboard shows "Trials Expiring" alert section. Color: amber. |
| **Multi-currency** | Per-subscription `currency` field. Settings: `base_currency`. Exchange rates via `open.er-api.com` (free, no key needed). Dashboard converts all to base currency. |
| **Budget Alerts** | `monthly_budget` in user_settings. Dashboard progress bar: "₹2,400 of ₹3,000". Bar turns amber at 80%, red at 100%. |
| **Email Reminders** | Supabase Edge Function (`send-reminders`) runs on a cron schedule (pg_cron). Queries subscriptions due in N days, sends via Resend API. |

### 🟡 Medium Priority

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| **Subscription Templates** | `TEMPLATES` constant in `packages/utils`. 15 popular services pre-filled (Netflix ₹649, Spotify ₹119, YouTube Premium ₹189, iCloud ₹75, Zomato Pro ₹99, AWS, etc.). Quick-add chips in modal. |
| **Calendar View** | 5th nav tab. Monthly calendar grid showing payment amounts on their due dates. Click a date to see that day's subscriptions. |
| **Cancellation Tracking** | `status` field: active/cancelled/paused. Soft-cancel keeps data. Analytics shows historical spend. "Cancelled" section in subscriptions page. |
| **Spending Trends** | `payment_history` table. Line chart (last 6 months). "Mark as Paid" button on reminder cards logs to history. |

### 🟢 Lower Priority

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| **Dark Mode** | Default dark, with full light mode via Tailwind `dark:` + next-themes. Toggle in Settings. |
| **Import from CSV** | Drag-and-drop CSV upload in Settings. papaparse parses → validation step → bulk insert. |

