## Animation Specs (from prompt)

| Event | Spec |
|-------|------|
| Page transition | 300ms slide+fade, `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` via Framer Motion `AnimatePresence` |
| Number count-up | 800ms ease-out, `AnimatedNumber` component using `requestAnimationFrame` |
| Donut chart draw | SVG `stroke-dashoffset` → 0, 1000ms ease-in-out, triggered by Intersection Observer |
| Card entry | Stagger: `delay = index * 60ms`, `opacity: 0→1` + `translateY: 20px→0` |
| Button hover | `scale(1.02)` + amber background shift, 150ms |
| Modal open | `translateY(100%)→0`, spring: `stiffness: 400, damping: 30` |
| Checkbox complete | Scale burst + teal fill, 400ms, card slides out 300ms after |
| Floating nav | Active tab expands with `width` transition, icon shifts up 2px |
| Background shape | `@keyframes breathe` — very slow scale 1→1.04→1, 8s infinite ease-in-out |
| Line chart draw | SVG `stroke-dashoffset` animated on Intersection Observer entry |

